The 8086/80186 CPU core (crates/icon-core/src/cpu/i86.rs and i186.rs) and the
TMS5220 speech synthesizer (crates/icon-core/src/devices/tms5220.rs) are ports
of MAME code and remain under the BSD 3-Clause license; see THIRD_PARTY.md.

This license covers the emulator's source code only. It does not cover the
ICON boot ROM, QNX, or any Unisys/CEMCORP software or disk images, which are
not distributed with this repository. disks/hd64-factory.bin contains blocks
written by the ICON's own hdformat/fdisk tools, including part of the QNX
hard-disk loader, and is not covered by this license.
